sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway
  participant R as Redis
  participant I as Identity JWKS
  participant O as Orders

  C->>G: HTTP request + optional bearer
  G->>G: request ID, trace, route and body policy
  G->>R: evaluate route limit
  R-->>G: allow or reject
  G->>I: refresh JWKS only on unknown kid
  G->>G: verify JWT and required coarse scope
  G->>O: service credential + safe actor context
  O-->>G: domain response / Problem Details
  G-->>C: normalized response + X-Request-ID
